%% Phase1 / post / MV3-G01j 创建评分活动并发送评分卡
%% 机器真源: cses-client phase1.manifest.json；Helix vote_score.rs；Java AverageScoreController/AverageScoreCommandHandler；Go post_update；Angular MessageAverageScoreContentComponent
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant UI as Angular ChatInput
  participant S as MessageService / MessageV3ImGate
  participant T as Tauri im_average_publish
  participant H as Helix Tick / vote_score
  participant J as Java CSES
  participant G as Go IM Server
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant DB as tenant SQLite
  participant WS as WebSocket
  participant B as EventSink im:__bus__
  participant ST as Angular store / signal
  participant V as MessageAverageScoreContentComponent
  UI->>S: openCreateAverageScore() / publishAverageScore(dto)
  Note over S,J: DTO: source,title,content,isAnonymous,isDelMaxMin,minScore,maxScore,members,cutoff,hasDecimal,decimalPlaces
  S->>T: invoke im_average_publish
  T->>H: Tick::Command(im_average_publish)
  H->>J: Effect::Http POST /average/publish
  J->>J: AverageScoreCommandHandler 创建 AverageScore
  J->>G: ImService.createPosts(type=AVERAGE_SCORE, props.averageScore)
  G->>PG: 保存 post/channel/channel_member/channel_event
  G-->>H: HTTP 2xx 仅表示请求返回，不等于 UI 已渲染
  G-->>WS: post_update(type=AVERAGE_SCORE)
  WS->>H: Tick::Inbound(post_update)
  H->>DB: Effect::PersistAtomic(message/channel/cursor)
  DB-->>H: PortReply(PersistOk)
  H->>B: Effect::Emit im:post:updated
  B->>ST: IpcEventService upsert / engagement confirm
  ST->>V: props.averageScore signal 更新并渲染评分卡
  Note over UI,V: 创建评分对象与发送评分卡是两段链路；HTTP 2xx、WS 收帧、PersistOk、UI 渲染是四个不同终态
